```

Every branch that skips an org now records why (reminders_disabled, free_quota with the count, no_overdue), and orgs that get reminders log how many. I used BullMQ's `job.log()`, so the lines are attached to each job run and visible in Bull Board under the job's Logs tab. Typecheck passes. One thing I noticed while reading: `reminderCountThisMonth >= 20` is checked before anything else, so a free org that hit its quota early in the month is skipped silently for the rest of it - that may be your culprit. I've kicked off the worker tests in the background.

